  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2030beyond kokkedyst og Verdensm&#xe5;lenes Plads, Folkem&#xf8;det 2024-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of Danida&#x2019;s support to Verdensm&#xe5;lenes Plads at Folkem&#xf8;det is to increase public knowledge and engagement in the Danish development cooperation and the SDGs with a special emphasis on engaging students - prior, during and after Folkem&#xf8;det. An additional objective in the project is to strengthen Kenyan civil society&#x2019;s engagement in democratic participation and sustainability.
Public engagement in Danish development cooperation is founded in the Law on International Development Cooperation and highlighted in the Development Policy Strategy &#x201c;The World we Share&#x201d; from 2021.</narrative>
  </description>
